# WEKEZA NASI — PROJECT BIBLE

## 1. IDENTITY

Name: WEKEZA NASI

WEKEZA NASI is an investment education, information,
analysis and community platform.

Starting market:
Tanzania — Dar es Salaam Stock Exchange (DSE)

Long-term direction:
Tanzania → Africa

Mission:
To help every investor understand investment through
simple, accurate, timely and trustworthy information.

Core promise:
"WEKEZA NASI ni mshirika wa safari yako ya uwekezaji."

Desired user feeling:
"Nimekutana na mkombozi wa uwekezaji."

---

## 2. TARGET USERS

WEKEZA NASI serves:

L0 — Complete beginner
L1 — Beginner
L2 — Learner
L3 — Investor
L4 — Advanced investor
L5 — Investment coach / expert

The system should support a user from beginner
to advanced investor progressively.

