                                                                                                   ## 6. PRODUCT PRINCIPLES

                                                                                                   WEKEZA NASI must:

                                                                                                   - Put education first
                                                                                                   - Use simple language
                                                                                                   - Prioritize accurate information
                                                                                                   - Provide timely information
                                                                                                   - Build trust
                                                                                                   - Avoid investment hype
                                                                                                   - Help users understand before acting
                                                                                                   - Support progressive learning
                                                                                                   - Build community
                                                                                                   - Keep the user at the center

                                                                                                   AI should educate and assist.
                                                                                                   It should not simply tell users what to buy or sell.

